  "title": { "en": "Yesterday", "uz": "Kecha", "ru": "Вчера", "tr": "Dün" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Talk about the past: where you were and what you did.",
    "uz": "O'tmish haqida gapiring: qayerda bo'lganingizni va nima qilganingizni ayting.",
    "ru": "Расскажите о прошлом: где вы были и что делали.",
    "tr": "Geçmişten bahset: nerede olduğunu ve ne yaptığını söyle."
  },
  "guide": "rocky",
  "color": "#7C3AED",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "Was, -ed and did", "uz": "Was, -ed va did", "ru": "Was, -ed и did", "tr": "Was, -ed ve did" },
    "body": {
      "en": "In the past, \"am\" and \"is\" become \"was\", and \"are\" becomes \"were\": I was at home. We were tired. Most verbs add -ed: watch - watched. Some verbs change completely: go - went, eat - ate, see - saw. The past form is the same for every person: I went, she went, they went. In questions and negatives use \"did\" + the base verb: Did you eat? I did not sleep.",
      "uz": "O'tgan zamonda \"am\" va \"is\" o'rniga \"was\", \"are\" o'rniga \"were\" keladi: I was at home. We were tired. Ko'p fe'llarga -ed qo'shiladi: watch - watched. Ba'zi fe'llar butunlay o'zgaradi: go - went, eat - ate, see - saw. O'zbek tilidan farqli, fe'l shaxsga qarab o'zgarmaydi: I went, she went, they went. Savol va inkorda \"did\" + fe'lning asosiy shakli ishlatiladi: Did you eat? I did not sleep (\"did not slept\" emas).",
      "ru": "В прошедшем времени \"am\" и \"is\" превращаются в \"was\", а \"are\" — в \"were\": I was at home. We were tired. К большинству глаголов добавляется -ed: watch - watched. Некоторые глаголы меняются полностью: go - went, eat - ate, see - saw. В отличие от русского, форма не зависит от рода и числа: he went, she went, they went. В вопросе и отрицании нужен \"did\" + начальная форма глагола: Did you eat? I did not sleep (а не \"did not slept\").",
      "tr": "Geçmiş zamanda \"am\" ve \"is\" yerine \"was\", \"are\" yerine \"were\" gelir: I was at home. We were tired. Çoğu fiile -ed eklenir: watch - watched. Bazı fiiller tamamen değişir: go - went, eat - ate, see - saw. Türkçeden farklı olarak fiil kişiye göre değişmez: I went, she went, they went. Soru ve olumsuz cümlede \"did\" + fiilin yalın hâli kullanılır: Did you eat? I did not sleep (\"did not slept\" değil)."
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "I was at home.", "native": { "uz": "Men uyda edim.", "ru": "Я был дома.", "tr": "Ben evdeydim." } },
      { "en": "We watched a movie.", "native": { "uz": "Biz kino ko'rdik.", "ru": "Мы посмотрели фильм.", "tr": "Bir film izledik." } },
      { "en": "Did you eat?", "native": { "uz": "Ovqat yedingmi?", "ru": "Ты поел?", "tr": "Yemek yedin mi?" } }
    ]
  },
